From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: repatches <repatches@kimono.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:18:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mobile: Drop Immich's own links from the app

Kimono Photos shouldn't send people to Immich's docs, GitHub or Discord.

Must survive upstream changes:
- The account sheet footer keeps only "Licenses" (open-source notices stay).
- The start-up error screen keeps "Clear app data" but not the Discord and
  GitHub issue links.
- Update reminders are left alone: Kimono turns Immich's new-version check
  off in the server config and ships app and server together, so they
  don't appear.

diff --git a/mobile/lib/pages/common/splash_screen.page.dart b/mobile/lib/pages/common/splash_screen.page.dart
index 0d42387..c9a0ae7 100644
--- a/mobile/lib/pages/common/splash_screen.page.dart
+++ b/mobile/lib/pages/common/splash_screen.page.dart
